    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2A Duncairn Lane, Bray, Co. Wicklow A98 VY94\r\n\r\n2 Bedroom | 1 Bathroom | Approx. 70 sq. m | Private Garden | Excellent Town Centre Location\r\n\r\nDooley Auctioneers are delighted to present 2A Duncairn Lane, Bray, Co. Wicklow to the market. Tucked away in a quiet and secluded setting just off Duncairn Lane, this charming two-bedroom home offers an excellent combination of privacy and convenience, within easy walking distance of Bray town centre, the DART station, seafront and harbour.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 70 sq. m, the property is arranged over two floors and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation. The ground floor features an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a practical and sociable main living space. The kitchen provides a good range of fitted units and worktop space, while the adjoining living area is centred around an attractive feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises two bedrooms, together with a fully tiled family bathroom fitted with a bath and overhead shower. Velux rooflights and additional windows provide excellent natural light throughout the upper floor.\r\n\r\nExternally, one of the property's particularly appealing features is its private enclosed garden, a rare benefit for such a central Bray location. The garden provides a secluded outdoor space with ample room for outdoor seating and entertaining. The property also benefits from private and on-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a two-bedroom home in an exceptionally convenient yet surprisingly private location in the heart of Bray.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nGround Floor: Open-plan kitchen/dining area and living room with feature fireplace and access to the private garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: Landing, two bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nApprox. 70 sq. m\r\nTwo bedrooms\r\nOne bathroom\r\nBright open-plan kitchen/dining/living accommodation\r\nPrivate enclosed garden\r\nPrivate and on-street parking\r\nQuiet and secluded setting\r\nApprox. 2 minutes' walk from Bray DART Station\r\nShort walk to Bray Seafront & Promenade\r\nMinutes from The Harbour Bar\r\nWalking distance of Bray Main Street and town centre amenities\r\nExcellent public transport connections\r\nBER: TBC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\nApprox. 70 sq. m\r\nTwo bedrooms\r\nOne bathroom\r\nBright open-plan kitchen/dining/living accommodation\r\nPrivate enclosed garden\r\nPrivate and on-street parking\r\nQuiet and secluded setting\r\nApprox. 2 minutes' walk from Bray DART Station\r\nShort walk to Bray Seafront & Promenade\r\nMinutes from The Harbour Bar\r\nWalking distance of Bray Main Street and town centre amenities\r\nExcellent public transport connections\r\nBER: TBC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
