        "Content": "BER: D2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The location is a major selling point. Despite its peaceful and tucked-away position, 2A Duncairn Lane is just a couple of minutes' walk from Bray DART Station, providing excellent access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas. Bray Seafront, the promenade and the popular Harbour Bar are all within a few minutes' walk, while Bray Main Street and its wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities are also close at hand."
      }
